// offline-exam-run.bml — the body's exam with the network denied: form-stdlib/bml/offline-exam.bml holds the shape, its keys and its rows.
// stdin, optional, one JSON line: until_ms (the window's end on the host's monotonic clock; a kind or a set the time left cannot hold is named unread), kinds (comma list), sets (comma list, or "none"),
// answers and ledger (a band's lane: planted answers in place of the voice, into its own ledger), profile, host.
// Exit 0 when it read; a host with no sandbox-exec is refused by name, exit non-zero, no row.
// preflight-exec: forbidden
import form-stdlib/bml/offline-exam.bml;
section [form.bml] {
 oex-run(oex-opts());
}
